  "configuration_id": "config_018",
  "reason": "The strongest completed result is RNA-only PCA with multiprofile avgpool (0.591 accuracy, 0.573 F1), while image-only ResNet singleprofile is weak (0.208 accuracy). This leaves uncertainty about whether image features can add value when fused with the best RNA representation. config_018 keeps the proven RNA PCA/multiprofile/avgpool settings and adds ResNet with simple concat fusion, directly testing whether multimodal fusion improves over the RNA-only baseline. It is a focused extension of the current best direction and creates a useful baseline for later fusion or image-encoder comparisons under a limited budget."
}

